msgid ""
"本页由原 CSV 派生，不是新的状态权威、执行记录或软件资格。 原编号、顺序和全部原字段来自 {download}`原台账 "
"<../../design/soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>`。 源文件：`docs/design/soc-ip-lay"
"out-execution.csv`；SHA-256：`0564d12a1125e718b7560defc8a7cbb184c77ebeb1b1"
"3ba1eea1331b2cac8fa4`。"
msgstr ""
"This page derives from the original CSV; it is not a new status "
"authority, execution record or software qualification. Original "
"identifiers, order and all original fields come from the "
"{download}`original ledger <../../design/soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>`. "
"Source file: `docs/design/soc-ip-layout-execution.csv`; SHA-256: "
"`0564d12a1125e718b7560defc8a7cbb184c77ebeb1b13ba1eea1331b2cac8fa4`."

msgid ""
"不同台账范围重叠，不相加数量或计算全项目完成率。实现状态与软件、 物理状态分别解释；`development_passed` 不表示当前文档 "
"HEAD 已执行。 `qualification_record_authority` 要回到精确结果索引判断源码和范围。 绝对 "
"`/workspace`、`/dev/shm` 定位保留原字节，仅说明原执行主机位置； 可取得归档及 member 定位见 "
"[软件证据入口](../software-verification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Different ledgers overlap in scope; do not add their counts or calculate"
" a project-wide completion rate. Interpret implementation, software and "
"physical status separately. `development_passed` does not mean execution"
" at the current documentation HEAD. Consult the exact results index for "
"the source and scope of `qualification_record_authority`. Absolute "
"`/workspace` and `/dev/shm` locators retain their original bytes and "
"only identify the original execution host. See the [software-evidence "
"entry](../software-verification.md) for retrievable archives and member "
"locations."

msgid "**原退出字段**只有原 CSV 中实际存在的字段；任务、资格前提和合同链接 也按原文保留，不能据此补造某次执行。"
msgstr ""
"**Original exit fields** are only fields actually present in the "
"original CSV. Tasks, qualification prerequisites and contract links also"
" retain their original wording; they cannot be used to invent an "
"execution."

